# Champions of the Perfect (CR 601.2b, 701.4a, 607.2q): the additional cost beholds an Elf - Elvish Mystic, revealed from the hand - and exiles it.
# The 6/6 is cast with Forest and three Moxen for {3}{G}. When Bot2's Swords to Plowshares exiles it, the exiled Elvish Mystic returns to its
# owner's hand, and Bot1 gains 6 life from the 6/6.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Elvish Mystic
Champions of the Perfect
Mox Emerald
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Champions of the Perfect.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Elvish Mystic)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Hand = Mox Emerald
? Exile.Count = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Champions of the Perfect.Power = 6
? Bot1.Battlefield.Champions of the Perfect.Toughness = 6
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Champions of the Perfect)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Hand = Mox Emerald; Elvish Mystic
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Life = 26
